msgid "Migration Guide"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today we released Quarkus 2.16.0.Final with several improvements, bugfixes "
"and documentation refinements."
msgstr ""

msgid "Major changes are:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for time series operations and preloading data in the Redis "
"extension"
msgstr ""

msgid "Support for custom exception handling and XDS in the gRPC extension"
msgstr ""

msgid "More flexibility for the Cache extension configuration"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Several security-related improvements focused on improving the developer "
"experience"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To migrate from 2.15, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"wiki/Migration-Guide-2.16[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Redis"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We continue to extend the set of operations supported by the Redis "
"extension, this time with time series operations."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Similarly to what exists with Hibernate ORM and the `import.sql` file,\n"
"you can import data to your Redis instance on startup using an `import."
"redis` file.\n"
"More information about this feature is available in the link:/guides/redis-"
"reference#preload-data-into-redis[Redis reference guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "gRPC"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The gRPC extension now offers custom exception handling and support for XDS."
msgstr ""

msgid "Cache"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Most of the Cache extension configuration has been made runtime,\n"
"allowing you to define the cache configuration at runtime."
msgstr ""

msgid "Security"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Security-related annotations such as `@TestSecurity` or `@OidcSecurity` can "
"be defined on meta-annotations:\n"
"you can define a particular security configuration in a meta-annotation and "
"apply it on several methods."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Configuration properties are now expanded in `@RolesAllowed` annotations' "
"value."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `OidcClientFilter` has been improved to be able to select named OIDC "
"clients."
msgstr ""

msgid "Improvements to @IfBuildProfile and @UnlessBuildProfile"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for `allOf` and `anyOf` has been added to `@IfBuildProfile` and "
"`@UnlessBuildProfile`,\n"
"giving you more flexibility."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/2.16.0.CR1[2.16.0.CR1] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/2.16.0.Final[2.16.0.Final] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

